{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1510892-a-bunker","id":1510892,"title":"A bunker","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-06T10:24:19-07:00","id":1510892,"title":"A bunker","content":"I was working on this for a character concept, but I keep thinking about other Garou's reaction to it. A Garou that wants to prepare for the apocalypse, but not in a way of fighting it, but in a way of preparing for when it happens, he believes that the environment will become inhospitable even for a Garou so he has made preparations for a bunker, stocked with food, self-sustainable energy, an environment where they can grow plants for food and even guns, the only problem that I couldn't find a way around is the water, in this case I think only with magic or gifts, maybe a fetish with that function. One hurdle he would have was that just making a shelter like this would take a lot of money so he would give a VIP seat to anyone who agreed to fund the project, but I wonder what other Garou's reaction would be to that. I would say that the RT and GoF would not be good, even the Wendigo, but I'm in doubt about the others. What are you thougths.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-05-06T13:44:41-07:00","id":1510911,"title":"","content":"One thing I want to note; The umbra. Most garou who try to prepare for the apocalypse build their bunkers there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a hr